{"unit_id":"wangcong1137-hash__dsh-geoserver#feature-1","repo":"wangcong1137-hash/dsh-geoserver","commit":"76dcd379bdf9b0394175d625b8852ab138617008","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-geoserver 的功能「服务与图层列表」：通过 geoserver_list 查询工作区、图层、样式和影像格式，并尽量补充标题、边界与坐标系；REST 不可用时回退读取 WMS GetCapabilities。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:755-793"]}
